{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Well, I [Am]went down to Old [Dm]Joe's [Am]Barroom
[Am]Down on the [Dm]corner by the [C][E]square
[Am]They were [Dm]serving [Am]drinks as usual
Oh, the [C]usual [E]crowd was [Am]there
